''),(202,'version_sjf7z4','LQD_E_2_73','Added missing cyrillic translations as well as update sql so that it would automatically update DB.','global','E',0,1,1636145337,''),(203,'version_qxvo8d','LQD_E_2_74','Fix issue of Chinese and Russian not showing in dropdown box.','global','E',0,1,1636382140,''),(204,'version_qc27by','LQD_E_2_75','Left menu links for Chinese and Cyrillic language issue is fixed.','global','E',0,1,1636461783,''),(205,'version_z96gqx','LQD_E_2_76','Start pump response page Chinese and Cyrillic translation issues fixed\nDispense page and Dashboard Chinese, Cyrillic language bugs cleared','global','E',0,1,1636484038,''),(206,'version_gqryve','LQD_E_2_77','Language dropdown updated with multiple languages','global','E',0,1,1636646472,''),(207,'version_48wc19','LQD_E_2_78','Maintenance page browser tab title language issue resolved.\nBrowser tab Cyrillic language issues resolved\nDashboard Admin and Tech tab title issue is fixed','global','E',0,1,1637156903,''),(208,'version_r22omc','LQD_T_2_71','Maintenance page browser tab title language issue resolved.\nBrowser tab Cyrillic language issues resolved\nDashboard Admin and Tech tab title issue is fixed\nLanguage dropdown updated with multiple languages\nStart pump response page Chinese and Cyrillic translation issues fixed\nDispense page and Dashboard Chinese, Cyrillic language bugs cleared\nStart pump response page Chinese and Cyrillic translation issues fixed\nDispense page and Dashboard Chinese, Cyrillic language bugs cleared\nAdded missing Cyrillic translations as well as update sql so that it would automatically update DB.\nAdded Cyrillic and Chinese language access','global','T',0,1,1637162602,''),(210,'version_b0xvv6','LQD_E_2_79','Update oilcop/application/config/config.php file option $config[\'log_threshold\'] = 0 instead of 2 which is causing logs files to fill up the disk.','global','E',0,1,1652298163,''),(211,'version_i636l2','LQD_T_2_72','Updated oilcop/application/config/config.php file option $config[\'log_threshold\'] = 0; instead of it being 2 which created larger error logs.  Having this option set to 2 is filling up the disk.  This update and any others will fail to download if the disk is too full.  If disk is too full open the Files program and navigate to var/www/oilcop/application/logs and delete all files that start with \"log\" and end with \".php\", example log-2021-05-11.php, then don\'t forget to empty the trash before attempting to download the file.  The affects all controllers which have R34.','global','T',0,1,1652302736,''),(212,'version_ccajyx','LQD_R_2_35','IMPORTANT READ ALL REVISION NOTES:  Updated oilcop/application/config/config.php file option $config[\'log_threshold\'] = 0; instead of it being 2 which created larger error logs.  Having this option set to 2 is filling up the disk.  This update and any others will fail to download if the disk is too full.  If disk is too full open the Files program and navigate to var/www/oilcop/application/logs and delete all files that start with \"log\" and end with \".php\", example log-2021-05-11.php, then don\'t forget to empty the trash before attempting to update a system.  The affects all controllers which have R34 so all controllers running R34 should be updated with this revision.  Customers will not be able to fix any diskspace issues and will require TeamViewer or direct access to the controller to clean up the unnecessary files. To see if the disk is excessively full, type the following command in a terminal window: \"df -h\" without the quotes.  Look for the following line in the results: /dev/sda1 and under the heading Use% normally it should be less than 60% which is actually on the high end.','global','R',0,1,1652304073,''),(213,'version_lklw1e','LQD_E_2_80','Update config.php in the application/config folder to fix issue with cron job not sending out daily emails.','global','E',0,1,1653669014,''),(214,'version_k1pmu5','LQD_T_2_73','Updated config.php in the application/config folder to fix issue with cron job not sending out daily emails.  Confirmed emails were received by gartec.it and liquidynamics.com per email time schedule.','global','T',0,1,1653673927,''),(215,'version_i2djc7','LQD_R_2_36','Contains the fix for cron job emails not being sent, daily report in particular.','global','R',0,1,1654524495,''),(216,'version_1y58tx','LQD_E_2_81','Includes new Gartec and Filcar email server info, search feature for Select WO and Job Recipes for the tech, Admin WO format option is not able to be set to 20 characters to match DB structure, and when there is only one reel when selecting a job recipes it goes directly to the dispense page instead of having the user select the single reel.','global','E',0,1,1659356343,''),(217,'version_b0jh6c','LQD_T_2_74','Includes new Gartec and Filcar email server info, search feature for Select WO and Job Recipes for the tech, Admin WO format option is not able to be set to 20 characters to match DB structure, and when there is only one reel when selecting a job recipes it goes directly to the dispense page instead of having the user select the single reel.','global','T',0,1,1659356532,''),(218,'version_l8rlof','LQD_E_2_82','Removed unnecessary backup files from release that \'Includes new Gartec and Filcar email server info, search feature for Select WO and Job Recipes for the tech, Admin WO format option is not able to be set to 20 characters to match DB structure, and when there is only one reel when selecting a job recipes it goes directly to the dispense page instead of having the user select the single reel.\'','global','E',0,1,1659365640,''),(219,'version_dl7i7k','LQD_T_2_75','Removed unnecessary backup files from release that \'Includes new Gartec and Filcar email server info, search feature for Select WO and Job Recipes for the tech, Admin WO format option is not able to be set to 20 characters to match DB structure, and when there is only one reel when selecting a job recipes it goes directly to the dispense page instead of having the user select the single reel.\'','global','T',0,1,1659365743,''),(220,'version_g5tfvr','LQD_E_2_83','Fix Usage History slowing down the page load.','global','E',0,1,1662556627,'V1'),(221,'version_rfx8y6','LQD_R_2_37','Removed unnecessary backup files from release that \'Includes new Gartec and Filcar email server info, search feature for Select WO and Job Recipes for the tech, Admin WO format option is not able to be set to 20 characters to match DB structure, and when there is only one reel when selecting a job recipes it goes directly to the dispense page instead of having the user select the single reel.\'','global','R',0,1,1662733550,'V1'),(222,'version_w5qttw','LQD_E_2_84','Includes bug fix for R37 not finding reel when new job recipes are created.  Bug didn\'t show up if recipes previously created had a dispense against them.  Usage History causing slow loading of dashboard.','global','E',0,1,1663696156,'V1'),(223,'version_ypjggm','LQD_T_2_76','Includes bug fix for R37 not finding reel when new job recipes are created. Bug didn\'t show up if recipes existed before update and had a dispense against them. Usage History causing slow loading of dashboard is also included.','global','T',0,1,1663699725,'V1'),(224,'version_q66njl','LQD_R_2_38','Includes bug fix for R37 not finding reel when new job recipes are created. Bug didn\'t show up if recipes existed before update and had a dispense against them. Usage History causing slow loading of dashboard is also included.','global','R',0,1,1664194040,'V1'),(225,'version_npjn7b','LQD_E_2_85','Revert back to old Gartec email server, reel not found fix, login page footer addition, WO search feature addition,','global','E',0,1,1664903089,'V1'),(226,'version_3wfrjq','LQD_T_2_77','Revert back to old Gartec email server, reel not found fix, login page footer addition, WO search feature addition,','global','T',0,1,1664903292,'V1'),(231,'version_vkrwy3','LQD_E_2_86','Add admin option to 